| **campfire_crackle** | **0.46** | **0.90** | **0.61** | 20 | Background Fire |<br><br>---<br><br><h2>4.4 Hardware Execution Summary on ESP32-S3<br><br>- **Model Format**: TensorFlow Lite for Microcontrollers (TFLM) INT8 Quantized C++ Array (`model_data.h`)
- **Flash Footprint**: **16.8 KB** (16,864 bytes)
- **SRAM Allocations**: **42.5 KB** (Tensor Arena)
- **Inference Time per 3s Clip**: **11.4 ms** @ 240 MHz ESP32-S3 clock
- **Sleep Current Draw**: **15 µA** (Deep Sleep with Accelerometer/Energy Wakeup)
- **Active Current Draw**: **18.5 mA** (Continuous Audio Buffer Processing)<br><br>---<br><br>*Report generated automatically from experimental evaluation logs.*

